hot_5.png", "id": "346298789804805", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035356_346298793138138_4894884039018092206_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NeZ0Uftx8z4Q7kNvwH--E8z&_nc_oc=AdquUipwkZR1JeXZDrqvd4Rcjfb2Puwqrf4R9U-bn6DhBG1XJ8PDFgMfe2XRScZyeNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5QhtRt7us15ftVt1C_YsL7vVBWoulCJ7Mvm38Nf_Q0SA&oe=69FA0037"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ocl_video_2560x1440.png", "id": "1530109590524550", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031458_1530109593857883_34338324661498769_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q24wjTNn6tkQ7kNvwH1KZxM&_nc_oc=Adp8gfZbHN2zRdjaxjBnYGKtycx8BeeTFc_v23-F3lAhBfN9eG-lUymkeO9css7MXqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5VZ6PMuvivEQ-k-nYscj0KS9qtY0A2sXSZkvQwb20WdQ&oe=69F9F0DC"}, "display_name": "Sense Arena", "keywords": [], "long_description": "- Interactive drills in Sense Arena's environment will help improve reaction time, play tracking, puck tracking and active hands. Measurable results help in the goalie skills development process.\n\n- Watch interactive videos from real training sessions of top hockey organizations. Experience the speed and skills of higher age players. Develop your release reading.\n\n- Develop you cognitive skills and concentration.", "short_description": "Sense Arena is an off-ice training platform that improves players' Read & React cognitive capabilities, which are critical for peak performance. Our methodology and drills are developed in cooperation with professional NHL players and coaches. The University of Wisconsin-Stevens Point and The Charles University, Prague, have done studies on how players' performances are impacted by using Sense Arena.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sensearena.com/terms-and-conditions-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https